            "id": 145211,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Otomatik oynatma ayarının durumunu konsolda <code>false</code> görüntüleyerek göster.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Auto-play&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>console</code>, ardından <code>.</code> ve sonra <code>log</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>false</code>, <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
