            "id": 145212,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>autoSaveGame</code> değişkenini oluştur ve içine <code>true</code> değerini ata.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" autoSaveGame = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>const</code>, ardından <code>autoSaveGame</code> ve son olarak <code>true</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
